##### TypeScript: Remove space in comment-only object type ([#&#8203;19583](https://redirect.github.com/prettier/prettier/pull/19583) by [@&#8203;fisker](https://redirect.github.com/fisker))

<!-- prettier-ignore -->

```tsx
// Input
v

The Helm and Kubernetes manifests already reference `/health/live` and `/health/ready`, but the API did not expose those endpoints. This change wires probe endpoints into the ASP.NET Core host and aligns readiness with actual database availability.

- **Probe endpoint wiring**
  - Map `/health/live` via ASP.NET Core health checks so the process exposes a dedicated liveness route.
  - Map `/health/ready` separately so readiness can evolve independently from liveness.

- **Readiness behavior**
  - Add a database-backed health check using `EgoDbContext`.
  - Treat readiness as healthy only when the application can connect to PostgreSQL.

- **Failure handling**
  - Bound the readiness database check with a short timeout.
  - Return unhealthy status on connection failure or timeout, including exception context for diagnosis.

```csharp
builder.Services.AddHealthChecks()
    .AddCheck<DatabaseHealthCheck>("database", tags: ["ready"]);

app.MapHealthChecks("/health/live", new HealthCheckOptions
{
    Predicate = _ => false
});

app.MapHealthChecks("/health/ready", new HealthCheckOptions
{
    Predicate = registration => registration.Tags.Contains("ready")
});
```

